# Copy

Follow `design/voice.md`. Specific, dry, honest. Verbs for actions.

Forbidden: supercharge, seamless, unleash, all-in-one, Learn more, fake metrics, emoji icons, false urgency.

Unsourced numbers get `SAMPLE DATA` or they do not ship.
